\date{2025-10-25T00:34:28Z}
\title{Biography}
\author{brentyorgey}

\p{I am an associate professor in the [Department of Mathematics and Computer Science](https://hendrix-cs.github.io/) at [[hendrixcollege]] in Conway, Arkansas, USA. My research interests lie broadly within the fields of programming languages and discrete mathematics, with particular interests in functional programming languages, embedded domain-specific languages, category theory, combinatorics, and education.}

\p{I graduated from [[williamscollege]] in 2004, and obtained my PhD at the [[upenn]] in 2014, as part of the [Penn PL Club](http://www.cis.upenn.edu/~plclub/) and under the supervision of Dr. [[stephanieweirich]].}